sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web app (SSO session)
    participant B as Backend
    participant M as Mobile app
    participant K as Keychain / Keystore

    Note over U,W: Already signed in on a computer<br/>(ProConnect, Keycloak, Passage2...)
    U->>W: "Add a device"
    W->>B: POST /devices/enrollment-codes/ (session)
    B-->>W: qr_token (one-time, ~5 min), simple_code, expires_at
    W-->>U: QR code = https://host/enroll/{qr_token}<br/>+ 6-character code

    U->>M: Scan the QR (or type the code)
    M->>K: get or create device_key (random, never leaves the device)
    M->>B: POST /devices/enroll/ {qr_token, device_key, device_name}
    B->>B: consume qr_token (single use)<br/>create Device(user, key hash, name)
    B-->>M: device credential (refresh token bound to the Device)
    M->>K: store credential (this device only)

    loop Normal use
        M->>B: API calls / uploads with short-lived access token
        M->>B: refresh with the device credential (proves device_key)
    end

    U->>W: "My devices" → revoke
    W->>B: POST /devices/{id}/revoke/
    B-->>M: next refresh → 401, app returns to the enrollment screen
